WEBVTT

00:17:28.207 --> 00:17:32.391
over the next several decades.

00:17:32.391 --> 00:17:35.043
In conclusion, I've come to believe

00:17:35.043 --> 00:17:37.281
that the ingredients for the next Pantheons

00:17:37.281 --> 00:17:38.668
are all around us,

00:17:38.668 --> 00:17:40.855
just waiting for visionary people

00:17:40.855 --> 00:17:42.589
with the broad knowledge,

00:17:42.589 --> 00:17:44.199
multidisciplinary skills,

00:17:44.199 --> 00:17:46.067
and intense passion

00:17:46.067 --> 00:17:51.153
to harness them to make their dreams a reality.

00:17:51.153 --> 00:17:53.649
But these people don't spontaneously

00:17:53.649 --> 00:17:54.988
pop into existence.

00:17:54.988 --> 00:17:56.827
They need to be nurtured and encouraged

00:17:56.827 --> 00:17:58.606
from when they're little kids.

00:17:58.606 --> 00:18:00.466
We need to love them and help them